WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:35.820
"Cross Days"

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:39.950
1955

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:43.080
1955, New York City

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:54.910
Welcome, Your Highness.

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:57.800
May I present the Crown Prince of the Kingdom of Raginei...

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:00.830
His Highness Machaty Sheik Di Raginei!

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:07.190
These people have no manners.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:09.460
Your Highness!

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:12.920
There's no use trying to explain the teachings of the Lord Ragi to these heathens.

00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:14.920
I'm going to my room.

00:02:16.790 --> 00:02:18.890
Di--did I offend him?

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:22.180
The religion of Ragi is one of sun worship.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:25.620
The head, the closest part of you to the sun, is considered sacred.

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:29.030
In front of His Highness, consider wearing a hat.

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:34.090
Four whole days in this vulgar country!

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:37.500
Even though a month from now I have to take the throne!

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:41.310
With the Global Economic Summit four days away,

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:44.770
delegates from many of the world's nations are arriving in America.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:47.840
The United Kingdom proposed this summit in response to predictions...

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:51.440
of a resource decline accompanying rapid economic growth.

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:52.500
In particular, oil...

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.500
Vultures gathering to feed...

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:56.680
It's a summit in name only.

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.680
The real reason they've come...

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.860
is to covet my country's oil, and wave around their own privileges.

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.390
That's exactly why...

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:06.580
it is necessary for Your Highness to attend in person.

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:22.940
Even though it's nighttime...

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:25.010
everything is bathed in light.

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:29.600
To make Raginei a wealthy nation like this... I hope I can do it.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:33.190
No... I have to do it.

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:37.520
And then... I'll drive the white men off of the soil of Ragi!

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:40.270
I won't let the world powers...

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:42.460
have their way with my country!

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:46.210
His Highness is in a bad temper?

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:47.580
I'm afraid so.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:50.090
Well, His Highness is fifteen years old...

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:52.090
he's still very young.

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:53.980
At a difficult time like this...

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:56.480
His Majesty the King's illness is truly painful...

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:04.850
Compliments of the British Consul.

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:11.080
Villain!

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:15.700
Flee, Your Highness!

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:22.680
Crown Prince, prepare yourself!

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:31.480
Not with a gun!

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:48.830
The collection truck is here already.

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:50.430
We'd better hurry.

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:06.230
He's nowhere to be found!

00:05:06.460 --> 00:05:09.070
Call the manager immediately, and contact the police!

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:11.070
But in the meantime, His Highness could be--!

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.830
Proceed in secret, with all possible speed!

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:16.500
If something were to happen to His Highness now...

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:17.970
the royal family would cease to exist!

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.700
It stopped...

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.000
Where in the world is the hotel?

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:06.720
Day after day I sing in a noisy bar...

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.260
it's enough to live on, but...

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:12.120
it feels empty, somehow.

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:24.180
Don't startle me like that!

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:28.420
I get it, you're here for tonight's "hat party," right?

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:34.780
But that's a whole costume!

00:06:35.050 --> 00:06:36.580
What country's native dress is that supposed to be?

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.920
It's the informal attire of the royal family of Raginei.

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:40.450
Come on in.

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:43.140
You're so young, they'll never let you in the door...

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.340
but I'll sneak you in the back way.

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:48.180
Insolent wretch! Don't touch me!

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:51.220
You're even in character!

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:53.690
I'm Kathleen. Pleased to meetcha.

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:09.550
...it really is...

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:10.770
Fred!

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:12.220
Kathleen!

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.520
I want to introduce you to someone.

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:17.460
Gee, that's some flashy guest you've got there.

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:19.460
From that country--whatchamacallit...

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:20.670
It's "Raginei."

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:23.770
Right, he's here as a Prince of Rabbity.

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:26.630
Fred is a newspaper reporter.

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:29.410
That's just temporary...

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:31.410
pretty soon I'll be a novelist.

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:34.650
Nice to meet you. I'm Fredrick Burnsworth.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:38.440
Who gave you permission to touch me?

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:41.630
Perhaps you wish to die for your insolence!

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:44.030
Is he a funny kid or what?

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.030
St--stop that.

00:07:46.470 --> 00:07:48.030
He's so cute!

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:52.790
Would you care for something to drink?

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:04.940
Oh, no... the kid drank champagne...

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:07.300
What is this stuff?

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:09.300
It's water that sends you to paradise...

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:11.300
the Water of God.

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:13.300
It's not for kids to drink.

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:15.900
I can't understand it...

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:20.620
My religious studies instructors never mentioned anything like this...

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.900
Hey, I told you, cut it out!

00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:24.900
I told you not to touch me!

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:28.140
People who can't stand to be touched don't get any.

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:32.460
Fine. I'll allow it.

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:37.540
On this day, now and from this moment on...

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:40.060
I shall appoint thee to the rank of Royal Handmaiden.

00:08:40.810 --> 00:08:42.060
Kneel.

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:46.920
As master...

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:48.680
representative of the Lord Ragi...

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:52.490
and ruler of Raginei, in the name of First Prince Machaty Sheik...

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:55.200
we grant to Kathleen the rank of Royal Handmaiden.

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:59.920
Wilt thou dedicate thy life unto the royal family?

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:03.010
O--okay... I guess...

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:04.670
Good!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:06.570
Now hurry, hand over the Water of God!

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.140
Hey, no way.

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:10.630
Please stop it!

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:13.900
C'mere and give the Boss a little "service," you.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:17.110
I'm begging you, please let me go!

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.840
Gaglione Family hoodlums!

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:25.580
Hey... get a little closer, now.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.740
Frank, stop screwing around.

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:33.600
This girl only just got here.

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:36.520
You've got some spirit, Kathleen...

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:42.440
You're gonna spend some time with me.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:45.110
You haven't picked tonight's customer, have you?

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:49.310
Get the hell out and never come back!

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.060
You'd better learn your place!

00:09:53.060 --> 00:09:53.990
Or what?

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:57.020
Come, now, this is childish, Frank...

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:59.020
Shut up! Stay out of this!

00:10:00.310 --> 00:10:01.300
Fred!

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:04.280
See, you'd better do as I say...

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:06.280
like go out with me tonight.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.930
That woman is my handmaiden.

00:10:12.650 --> 00:10:14.220
You may not harm her!

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:18.140
Y--you little--!

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:32.280
Depart!

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:34.620
I'll remember this!

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:37.630
The Water of God!

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:39.470
--The Water of God!
--Ack, give it up!

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:54.270
He went right to sleep.

00:10:55.020 --> 00:10:57.010
It's hard to believe the fight from earlier really happened.

00:10:57.480 --> 00:10:59.330
Those guys are going to go looking for revenge.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.430
You'd better hide out here for a little while, too.

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:07.800
This cloth! It's top-quality silk!

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:11.070
Maybe he's really the son of some wealthy tycoon...

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:13.020
Oh!

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:14.570
This stuff is gold thread!

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:16.410
Amazing!

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:19.390
This is some craftsmanship.

00:11:19.480 --> 00:11:21.050
It's obvious even to the untrained eye.

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:33.580
You're in charge of covering the Global Economic Summit...

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:34.880
Eh?

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:37.080
The Kingdom of Raginei is supposed to participate, right?

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:41.100
Oh, yes! The present King is ill...

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:43.440
so the Crown Prince is here instead.

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:45.340
Prince Machaty?

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:47.100
Wow, you know your stuff...

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:48.630
Do you have a picture?

00:11:57.830 --> 00:11:59.380
Find that cloth!

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:02.010
Where'd you go, Fred?

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:04.010
Kathleen! You--

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:06.340
you slept in the same bed with him?

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:09.200
But your sofa's so uncomfortable...

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:12.080
He's the real thing!

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:15.990
First Prince Machaty of the Kingdom of Raginei!

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:19.510
That woke you up!

00:12:19.780 --> 00:12:21.270
They say that in the Kingdom of Raginei...

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:23.470
if you willfully remove that headcloth...

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:25.470
they'll behead you for the insult!

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:29.370
Where is that cloth?

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:31.370
Eek! That's my skirt!

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:34.110
Found it! Here it is!

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:36.370
F-- Fred...

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:38.370
He's opening his eyes!

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:50.680
Your Highness the Crown Prince Machaty Sheik Di Raginei!

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:53.450
Did I...

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:56.660
grant you the honor of speaking my name?

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:06.290
Would you be Master Burnsworth?

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:09.830
I received your message, I'm a subject of Raginei.

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:14.010
Let him in.

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:16.350
Your Highness!

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:20.190
I'm so grateful you're safe!

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:22.190
It took you long enough, Jabir.

00:13:23.420 --> 00:13:25.320
It's like watching some movie...

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:28.450
I can't tell you how sorry we are about all this...

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:31.330
Would you mind telling us what's going on?

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:35.220
The truth is... there were assassins after His Highness.

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:40.210
The plot was instigated by Great Britain, and carried out by heretics from Raginei.

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:42.410
Your Highness!

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:43.940
If only there were no King...

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:46.400
then neither would there be unity among the believers.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:49.050
And Great Britain, without dirtying its hands...

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:51.270
could have all the oil rights to themselves.

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:54.440
Those people think only of what they can steal...

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:56.440
this plot looks like their work.

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:58.000
It can't be...

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:02.100
It can... the Kingdom of Raginei may be an autonomous territory of Great Britain...

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:04.100
but political power rests with the throne.

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:06.680
Taking the royal family out of the picture...

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:09.660
putting in a government you can freely manipulate...

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.660
that could be exactly what they're thinking.

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:14.520
As it stands, of course, let's go back to our country.

00:14:15.390 --> 00:14:17.200
Nothing is worth Your Highness' life.

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:19.270
You're telling <i>me</i>...

00:14:19.890 --> 00:14:20.900
to run?

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:24.750
The dignity of my country demands that I attend the summit!

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:29.170
Well then, how about you stay hidden away like this...

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:31.420
and only appear for the summit?

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:33.760
Perfect!

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:35.760
Security at the assembly hall will be tight, won't it?

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:38.360
Assassination would be out of the question, right?

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:40.360
That's a good idea!

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:42.130
It is?

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:43.430
Mr. Burnsworth!

00:14:43.760 --> 00:14:46.480
Thank you so much for your generous proposal!

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:48.940
Well... that's not exactly what I meant...

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:50.600
right, Kathleen?

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:52.250
Ah--oh, yes.

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:53.750
Madame Kathleen.

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:56.380
You received the rank of Royal Handmaiden.

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:59.460
Even among the high-born women of Raginei...

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:01.990
not a single one has managed that.

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:04.870
So please serve His Highness without reservation!

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:06.870
So why me, then!?

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:08.760
It's settled, then.

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:11.820
Kathleen, show me to my room.

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:13.820
This is a shed, right?

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:16.300
Well, excuse me and my shed here...

00:15:16.300 --> 00:15:17.580
As long as you're at it...

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:19.580
my house looks just like it.

00:15:20.050 --> 00:15:22.740
And here I'd heard America was a wealthy country...

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:25.060
Oh! I get it.

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:26.690
This must be the slums.

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:29.360
Kathleen!

00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:31.990
Your Highness, that way...

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:37.320
What was she so angry about?

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.320
I have no idea...

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:41.850
This is why I hate women.

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:43.610
Your Highness...

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.850
Hating women could be problematic...

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:48.980
Having children will be my duty as King.

00:15:49.490 --> 00:15:50.980
I will marry.

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:52.790
But I'll still hate women.

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:57.220
So it's okay for him to act that way because he's a prince?

00:15:57.570 --> 00:15:59.220
I'm here to apologize in his place.

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:02.000
In all his life, His Highness...

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.780
has never been allowed to take a single step outside the Royal Palace.

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:08.070
It's the law for royalty...

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:12.000
the future King must be kept away from all danger.

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:14.180
Really...

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:16.520
But... his wedding is one month from now.

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:20.390
I must keep trying to teach His Highness, little by little...

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:23.210
Wedding...

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:30.180
Getting married while you still don't know anything about the world...

00:16:30.890 --> 00:16:32.180
You can't help feeling sorry for him...

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:34.860
Kathleen!

00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:37.370
What do you think?

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:39.980
Oh, my gosh, he's adorable!

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:42.880
The custom in Raginei says...

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:44.800
it's better if your head isn't showing, right?

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:48.430
Jabir! When did you turn into the white people's little pet dog?

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:51.970
Your Highness! It wasn't like that at all...

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:53.970
There was no choice!

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:56.690
Jabir couldn't walk around looking so conspicuous.

00:16:57.480 --> 00:17:00.440
He didn't want to cut his hair, but he did it, for your sake!

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:01.970
Shut up!

00:17:03.050 --> 00:17:04.150
Something smells bad.

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:11.170
Stay out, all of you!

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:14.790
What in the heck are you sulking about?

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:16.530
I'm not bringing your dinner in there!

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:19.410
This is supposed to be a free country.

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:20.630
That being the case...

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:24.920
I ought to have the right not to eat bad-tasting food.

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:29.410
His attitude was haughty, with a universal disdain for his fellow man...

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:33.080
his arrogance let him abuse the goodwill of others without a second thought...

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:38.380
he had been waited on every moment of his life...

00:17:39.230 --> 00:17:42.130
and yet for all that, Machaty was fascinating in the extreme...

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:44.130
and he overflowed with charm.

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:01.110
Kajika!

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:02.590
Fred!

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:06.560
Welcome to our home.

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:08.570
I finally got to invite you...

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:11.340
Let me take a good look at that face...

00:18:12.590 --> 00:18:16.380
The resemblance is so strong now... it's almost like magic.

00:18:16.850 --> 00:18:19.130
Who is it I resemble? Kathleen?

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:22.300
Ah... yes, indeed.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:24.450
Hm?

00:18:25.490 --> 00:18:27.100
This is Toranosuke Haga...

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:29.150
my bodyguard.

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:30.620
Nice to meet you.

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:33.750
The gentleman on his left is Lee-Leng, the one I always talk about.

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:35.930
It's an honor to meet you at last...

00:18:35.930 --> 00:18:37.640
Mr. Burnsworth.

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:39.640
Call me Fred.

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:42.880
Wow... it looks just like the pictures!

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:46.450
Except covered in dust.

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:49.780
It's been three years since Kathleen passed away...

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:51.230
Aren't you lonely?

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:54.020
Harry invited me to come live together...

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:56.970
but I have no desire to leave here.

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:02.620
Is this Miss Kajika's grandmother?

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:05.230
She really has that All-American Beauty thing...

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:07.670
Chairman Harry, though...

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:09.670
he looks sort of Asian on first glance.

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:11.300
Toranosuke.

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:13.780
I don't approve of this intrusiveness.

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:15.780
Ah--... I'm sorry...

00:19:16.350 --> 00:19:19.020
It happens a lot in America...

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:21.020
since so many people are multiracial.

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:28.460
I'm sorry for what I said earlier.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:32.670
It's considered taboo to touch on Harry's birth.

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:36.390
Whether he's really adopted...

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:39.070
or the product of a previous marriage...

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:41.240
Since Kathleen died...

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:43.240
Fred now insists he is his own child.

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:47.270
Either way, the truth is shrouded in darkness...

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:54.760
--Did I wake you?
--Kajika?

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:58.010
Well, you see... my room is incredibly cute!

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:01.350
They said Kathleen got it ready especially for me.

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:02.590
Come see!

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:05.080
It's late... I'll come tomorrow morning.

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:07.660
You could come for a second...

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:09.570
Kajika...

00:20:09.570 --> 00:20:11.350
how old are you again?

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:17.560
What's wrong with him? He's so stingy! Why is he so mean to me!

00:20:17.810 --> 00:20:20.210
Stubborn jerk! Rotten to the core!

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:25.430
Who's rotten to the core?

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:28.250
Lee-Leng...

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:31.690
I can see now how long Fred Burnsworth and his wife...

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:33.690
were waiting for you, Kajika.

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:36.820
Kathleen...

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:39.160
What's wrong?

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:41.160
There was something you wanted to say...

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:44.400
No...

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:46.400
It doesn't matter.

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:48.940
I just felt a little lonely.

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:01.820
You surprised me! I went to your room, but you weren't there.

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:04.980
That's because the fish from this lake are delicious.

00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:08.860
I thought I'd let everyone have some of my catch.

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:12.460
And how are you doing, by the way?

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:15.190
I hear Harry made you an odd proposal...

00:21:15.630 --> 00:21:18.180
Oh, you mean the Husband Hunting Game?

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:20.330
I've only found one so far...

00:21:21.180 --> 00:21:23.910
but I don't even know whether he is one or not...

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:26.310
Wanna see a picture?

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:31.990
Ho ho, there's a handsome fellow.

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:34.600
His name is Eugene. But...

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:36.600
he's also the reincarnation of Mustafa.

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:38.970
I see.

00:21:38.970 --> 00:21:40.400
Do you like him?

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:41.510
Yep.

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:43.320
How about Lee-Leng?

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:45.030
Of course I like him.

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:47.290
But he's not a husband candidate?

00:21:47.830 --> 00:21:50.770
That's impossible... Lee-Leng is my dear big brother.

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:53.210
He wouldn't do for husband-y stuff.

00:21:54.060 --> 00:21:55.890
"Husband-y stuff?"

00:21:56.280 --> 00:21:59.630
Someone so close to you for so long should be a brother, right?

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:03.630
Getting married is still far in the future for you.

00:22:04.620 --> 00:22:05.740
Right!

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:08.890
Also, recently, I made one more friend.

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:11.750
His retainers wouldn't let me take a picture, so I had to be sneaky.

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:15.600
See, he's a prince! It causes a lot of difficulties.

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:17.960
A prince?

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:20.740
Rumaty, of the Kingdom of Raginei!

00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:23.900
Machaty...

00:22:23.970 --> 00:22:26.450
No, this is Rumaty.

00:22:26.580 --> 00:22:28.450
Machaty is his grandfather.

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:30.920
My God...

00:22:36.180 --> 00:22:37.490
Fred?

00:22:38.380 --> 00:22:40.470
Machaty's grandson and Kajika...

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:43.800
Fred!?

00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:46.890
Fred...

00:22:46.890 --> 00:22:49.170
Sooner or later I will come for Kathleen.

00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:51.450
Until then, I leave her in your hands...

00:22:51.860 --> 00:22:52.960
our mutual friend.

00:22:54.160 --> 00:22:56.460
Alas, Machaty...

00:22:57.080 --> 00:22:58.690
has come back...

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
